  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fb549623129da67e",
      "translationZh": "偶然看到一篇帖子，讲的是用打过补丁的 sglang 版本将新版 Qwen 优化到 178t/s：https://github.com/jpezzulli/sglang-rtxpro6000",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c64817368ef19e90",
      "translationZh": "我成功复现了结果（向 jpezzulli 致敬，不管你是谁），并发现还有一些进一步提速的空间（这个模型在 nvfp4 下的理论带宽上限对应的速度约为 280t/s），于是我让 fable 迭代了几天，继续提升速度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "786c9ceb46b4aca3",
      "translationZh": "结果：在单张 rtx 6000 pro maxq（300W）上，解码速度接近 240t/s。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4f2ab092aa6eaae1",
      "translationZh": "补丁针对的是 https://huggingface.co/RadixArk/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVFP4 ，并直接应用于 sglang 主库。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0ec124b96fd803c1",
      "translationZh": "将 lm head 和另外几个层从 bf16 进一步量化为 fp8（减少带宽占用）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f86460c4ed5a67f2",
      "translationZh": "对几个层进行内核调优，以提高 GPU 效率",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d936bdcbe6cfd3c3",
      "translationZh": "接下来几天我会测试的其他技巧：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c97d92a2f7bbc0df",
      "translationZh": "进一步量化各层，使其完全采用 nvfp4（可能不值得，因为这可能会导致性能下降）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "49704dd7094e0796",
      "translationZh": "进一步调优内核，以融合部分层",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bd2d332b96be15fb",
      "translationZh": "对 MTP 进行后训练，并且可以尝试创建一个 eagle3 预测头（真正的收益在这里，但不确定在实际测试中表现会如何）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "35f4f1ed67e77773",
      "translationZh": "复现所需资源：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "985f8d3a977b7fff",
      "translationZh": "我作为起点使用的仓库：https://github.com/jpezzulli/sglang-rtxpro6000",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "43c232665dd5ce1a",
