      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1b95761de5a336e4",
      "translationZh": "如果你有让它运行得更快的想法，欢迎提出更多可供测试的技巧 :)",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "be94b1c5d8392e09",
      "translationZh": "测试时使用的配置：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a34d65b234f49e09",
      "translationZh": "Ryzen 9 3950x（16/32 核心）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8c68190807e22c3b",
      "translationZh": "128gb 内存 @3600（用于存放 ngram 表）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5edb82e2387547af",
      "translationZh": "更新：准确率测量",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8fb1acbc272b4489",
      "translationZh": "我没法将这个模型与 bf16 部署进行对比测评，因为目前还没有提供商能可靠地提供这种部署的服务，所以我让它在我们公司的内部基准测试中与其他几个模型进行对比，使用相同版本的测试框架。这个基准包含 103 项 AIOPs 任务，用于调查和排查复杂程度各异的现实 IT 事件，设计上与 terminal bench 很相似，现代 llms 解决这些任务每项大约需要 300k tokens。它确实名不虚传，表现与 Qwen3.8 27B 或 Deepseek Pro 0813 相当。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0f77c9214b9d68b5",
      "translationZh": "下方以 pennyroyal-sglang 的名称列出，使用上述 800k 上下文配置提供服务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d4ca73413e9b0fbe",
      "translationZh": "更新 2：昨天一整天，我都在 Oh My Pi 中使用这个模型，直接替换了我平时基于 Opus 4.8 使用的 Claude Code。说实话，我被震撼到了：能力相近，但指令遵循好得多，也就摆脱了 opus 的固执。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "203ccead87052b7f",
      "translationZh": "更新 3：该内部基准测试的一部分将在 October 前后公开，以供审查。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ef1c9b0a7ae3224b",
      "translationZh": "更新 4：在单流生成时，上下文长度达到 300-400k 之前，速度都相当稳定，为 210-250 t/s；在四流生成时，输入 token 处理速度约为 40k，输出解码速度为 400。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
